From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:50:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Sound: the prompt's waits end on Ctrl-E or Ctrl-C; HELP SET
 REALISM: SET -N

In the realism mode, SET <unit> ONLINE/OFFLINE/LOAD/UNLOAD/REWIND at the
sim> prompt waited for the spindle or tape transport without looking at
the keyboard, so neither the WRU character nor Ctrl-C could end it
(known issue 117).  The three waits (spindles, reels, streamers) now put
the console into run mode and poll the keyboard every 50 ms: the WRU
character (Ctrl-E) or Ctrl-C ends the wait early with a message; the
drive goes on in the background and a DO script stops there.

HELP SET REALISM describes the waits, the switch -N (return at once),
SHOW <unit> SPINDLE/TRANSPORT and the interrupt; HELP SET SOUND points
there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SuavtcpUxEC2vXhit3JaAg
---
